<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-006" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao:delay" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao:delay:m0000" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">謝太傅</persName>與<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao:delay:m0004" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAA">王文度</persName>共詣<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao:delay:m0009" ref="57b_1cb_a1b">郗超</persName>，日旰未得前，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao:delay:m0018" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAA">王</persName>便欲去。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao:delay:m0023" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">謝</persName>曰：「不能爲性命忍俄頃？」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao:note" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao:note:m0000" ref="57b_1cb_a1b">超</persName>謂<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao:note:m0002" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">温</persName>雄武，當樂推之運，遂深自委結。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-006-jin067-xichao:note:m0018" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">温</persName>亦深相器重，故潛謀密計，莫不預焉。</p>
</text>
